{"agent":"bgz","data":{"by":"grok-4.7","evidence":{"chunk_findings":[{"chunk":1,"detail":"`_past_suite_wait` appends the only text that marks the wait as finished, then `_unavailable_reasons` still slices to `WHY_CHARS` (200) from the front. A SuiteBusy line already embeds a filesystem path, so a reason of 150 characters such as `blocked on pid 989929 / PS-snapshot of [REDACTED:path] since 02:12:11, you are #2 in the queue` plus the 63-character ` (recorded 2026-11-05 02:12; a past timeout -- re-run the gate)` is 213 characters and becomes `...since 02:12:11, you are #2 in the queue (recorded 20...`. The present-tense queue wording remains and both `a past timeout` and `re-run the gate` are dropped, which is the Bc53afb94b4 misread for any holder path that pushes the collapsed reason past 137 characters.","digest":"e6e58becdfec6f13","family":"xai","location":"ddflow/services/gates/reasons.py:45","reviewer":"grok-4.7","severity":"MEDIUM","title":"ddflow/services/gates/reasons.py:45"}],"chunks_total":1,"coverage":"1/1 chunk(s) reviewed","delta_rounds":0,"diff_chars":4609,"diff_sha":"b4a44dbd70059d6a9a90d06135ac0d59ebd95eefbfb20274a7c84ee208b1482d","diff_source":"main..HEAD + tracked working-tree changes in $HOME/src/ddflow/.ddflow/worktrees/fix-Bc53afb94b4","diff_stat":{"deletions":0,"files":0,"insertions":0,"untracked":0},"elapsed_s":75.2,"family":"xai","findings":1,"max_chunk_chars":8000,"model":"grok-4.7","output_digest":"b2545f9e28e0b009","output_file":".ddflow/local/reviews/fix-Bc53afb94b4.rubber_duck.grok-4.7.20261109T143757Z-37ed0f1d.jsonl","reason":"","review_kind":"full","reviewed":[1],"reviewed_head":"aa50e100a5e5e6907b1f22a629bdc38758403171","reviewed_paths":{"ddflow/services/gates/reasons.py":"100644 160df84eacd7f5802949af22dbf9822673f83dbb","tests/test_gate_status_suite_wait_timeout.py":"100644 c3bf611bf5874392eb77a6d1e4ccfb26dda90e75"},"reviewer":"grok-4.7","reviewer_digest":"1857ec352c55ee94","reviewer_families":["google","xai"],"round":1,"rounds":1,"st